# %% [markdown]
# ## Interpretation
# The extra concentration coordinate does not improve achieved calibration. The
# optimizer retains a near-Gaussian queued candidate with the same r/readout as
# the Gaussian control. Paired confirmation changes are small and metric-dependent;
# statistical resemblance remains conditional on the observation layer and seed.
# This does not show that lower alpha can never help, that alpha is identified,
# or that the optimizer found a global optimum. No model default is changed.
# TrpB-like aggregate descriptors and static proxies do not establish ML learning
# efficiency, optimization success, long-sequence transfer or biological mechanisms.
